# Build context for the two Java images (service-core/Dockerfile, service-dispatcher/Dockerfile),
# which use the repository root as their context: the Maven modules and nothing else. client-web
# has its own context and its own .dockerignore.
*
!pom.xml
!lib-common/pom.xml
!lib-common/src
!service-core/pom.xml
!service-core/src
!dispatcher-sdk/pom.xml
!dispatcher-sdk/src
!service-dispatcher/pom.xml
!service-dispatcher/src
**/target
